OL,3,GNEWSAWhy has a set of summer roadworks
OL,4,Adragged on to November?
OL,5,
OL,6,FParts of a major summer road
OL,7,Fimprovement programme in southern
OL,8,FScotland are still taking place in
OL,9,FNovember.
OL,11,FThe upgrades in Dumfries were meant to
OL,12,Fbe carried out mainly during the school
OL,13,Fholidays with the last ones completed
OL,14,Fby the first week in September.
OL,16,FHowever, the road closure signs have
OL,17,Fgone up again this week causing travel
OL,18,Fheadaches and traffic queues at peak
OL,19,Fhours.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
