OL,3,GNEWSAWhy has a set of summer roadworks
OL,4,Adragged on to November?
OL,5,
OL,6,FLocal bus operators say it can lead to
OL,7,Ftheir customers becoming angry and
OL,8,Fabusive. Dumfries and Galloway Council
OL,9,Fhas blamed the weather and other
OL,10,F"operational pressures" for the work
OL,11,Foverrunning.
